(Amazon deforestation, gene expression, protein disorder) have no sources. The intro's remote-sensing and galaxy-morphology motivation is also uncited. Only Galaxy Zoo and the census pools are cited.\n   - Search topics: plankton imaging dataset; Amazon deforestation dataset; gene expression sequence-to-expression dataset; protein disorder with AlphaFold.\n\n3. **isotonic-recalibration-regression** (Related Work, Calibration, low, background)\n   - Anchor: \"Isotonic and binned maps from scores to outcome probabilities are standard calibration tools\".\n   - The cited calibration papers address probabilities. The method and the η² estimate use isotonic regression for continuous outcomes.\n   - Search topics: isotonic regression for conditional mean estimation; recalibration of regression predictions.\n\n## Not pursued\n- Post-selection / adaptive interval selection. The draft states plainly that the 1% fallback rule has no guarantee, so this would be speculative expansion.\n- More PPI variants. Several bib entries are not cited in the text (credit risk, cardiac, etc.) and are off-topic. The strategy file says not to cite them.\npostdraft_citation_weave_agent_claude_20261111_114006.log\npostdraft_citation_weave_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_agent_claude_20261111_114006.log\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\npostdraft_reference_retrieval.log\npostdraft_references.bib\npostdraft_references_provenance.json","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fi39St1EyJKiqde5UzXn4z"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9a95e96-2cf4-41d1-b724-cfa8cc26020e","uuid":"51642edd-edd5-4d4d-8fcc-97cd5179673a","timestamp":"2026-11-11T12:06:08.398Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 2\nVENUE.md\nanalysis\nclaims_grounding.json\ndraft_reference_gaps.json\ndraft_reference_gaps.md\ndraft_